# Docker build context exclusions
# Prevent local node_modules (pnpm virtual-store junctions) and build
# artifacts from being copied into the image and corrupting the pnpm
# workspace dependency layout.

**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Recursive too: the patterns above are matched against the context
# root only, so a nested env file such as infrastructure/docker/.env
# (which exists) was still being sent to the daemon. No build stage
# reads any .env file, so excluding them everywhere costs nothing.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Prisma local SQLite/dev artifacts
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Editor/OS
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Misc
FETCH_HEAD
